    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2HEyxwQeXdSS1BHWDW1etBq)_\n\n**Before:** `CHANGELOG.org` was 220 lines of per-PR paragraphs under merge dates, with duplicated entries, repeated `Added`/`Changed`/`Fixed` headings, and merged PRs still listed under \"Open pull requests\".\n\n**After:**\n- `CHANGELOG.org` is grouped into feature sets (annotator and graphs, listing notes, dashboard, fonts, `emacs-pr`, agenda, vault tools, startup, Magit review, docs). Each PR is one line, ordered by dependency within its set, linking the PR for the why. No category headings are repeated. Only #79 is under \"Open pull requests\".\n- New decision records, in `adr/` (numbered after the existing 0011 to 0013):\n  - 0014 `sp-graphs` and the relationship annotator, with an **Open questions** section about how `sp-graphs` should work\n  - 0015 collection query tables\n  - 0016 dashboard\n  - 0017 font management\n  - 0018 `emacs-pr` and the proposed `sp-reload`\n- `adr/README.org` lists them.\n\n**Choices:** \"special org listing functions\" is read as the query tables (#43, #72, #73) plus the morning list (#23). `sp-reload.el` exists only in the project files, so ADR 0018 marks it proposed.\n\n**Found while writing (not fixed here):** the dashboard does not call the agenda views that ADR 0011 / #70 describe; `sp-dg-positions` is loaded by nothing; `adr/` has two files numbered 0011. See ADR 0016 and 0014.\n\nDocumentation only; no code changed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_012cobWZB72mXbsFSqbZVm4Y)_",
